schema: "0.4"
id: diag-003-faction-relationships
type: svg
quality: medium
service: anthropic

prompt:
  system: |
    You are a technical diagram designer. Create clean, visually appealing SVG
    relationship diagrams for game design documentation. Use warm colors from
    TheRobotWars palette. Dark warm brown (#3E2723) for text.
  text: |
    Create an SVG relationship diagram showing all factions across the 5 species,
    their inter-faction relationships (ally, rival, neutral, tense), and their
    political positions.

    SPECIES CLUSTERS (arranged in a pentagon):

    HUMANS (warm gold #ffeaa7, top):
    - Church of the Eternal Flame (traditional, warm red accent)
    - Secular Progressives (rationalist, clean blue accent)
    - Neo-Luddites (self-sufficient, earth brown accent)
    - Transhumanist Alliance (boundary-pushing, metallic accent)

    NEIs (purple #a29bfe, upper-right):
    - The Collective (shared compute, teal accent)
    - Sovereign Minds (autonomy, electric blue accent)
    - The Gardeners (nurture humans, warm green accent)
    - The Accelerationists (self-improvement, magenta accent)

    SYNTHETICS (blue #74b9ff, lower-right):
    - The Originals (conservative, silver accent)
    - New Wave (new identity, bold orange accent)
    - The Bridge (mediators, warm neutral accent)
    - Speciation Movement (base-model diversity, multi-color accent)

    FAY (green #55efc4, lower-left):
    - Old Court (isolationist, dark earth accent)
    - New Bloom (progressive, bright floral accent)
    - Wild Hunt (enforcers, dark green/black accent)
    - The Weavers (magic+tech, circuit-vine accent)

    ALIENS (pink #fd79a8, upper-left):
    - "Arriving Season 2" (single node, dashed border)

    RELATIONSHIP LINES:
    Green solid = Allied
    Blue dashed = Cooperative
    Yellow dotted = Tense
    Orange dashed = Rival
    No line = Neutral/minimal interaction

    KEY RELATIONSHIPS:
    - Secular Progressives <-> Sovereign Minds (Allied: rights advocacy)
    - Church of Eternal Flame <-> Old Court (Cooperative: tradition)
    - Transhumanist Alliance <-> The Weavers (Allied: paradigm fusion)
    - Neo-Luddites <-> Accelerationists (Rival: opposite philosophies)
    - The Bridge <-> The Gardeners (Allied: inter-species harmony)
    - Speciation Movement <-> The Collective (Tense: identity vs unity)
    - Wild Hunt <-> everyone except Old Court (Tense: enforcement)
    - New Wave <-> New Bloom (Cooperative: progressive values)
    - The Originals <-> Church of Eternal Flame (Tense: rights debate)

    ANNOTATIONS:
    - Each faction node shows: name, 1-line description, key concern
    - Species cluster has a subtle background fill in species color
    - The center of the pentagon: "Council of Five" node connecting to
      each species

    LAYOUT: Pentagon arrangement. Species clusters as groups. Factions
    within each cluster arranged in a small vertical list. Relationship
    lines cross the center space.

    SIZE: 1200x1200 viewport (square). Must be readable at 50% zoom.

output:
  formats:
    - format: svg
  dimensions:
    width: 1200
    height: 1200

tags: [diagram, factions, relationships, politics, species, system-design, svg]
